During development, the AI server is the Windows desktop.

Current development hardware:

```text
CPU:
AMD Ryzen 7 7800X3D

RAM:
32 GB

GPU:
NVIDIA RTX 4070 SUPER
12 GB VRAM
```

Later, this role will move to a dedicated Linux workstation/server with a larger-VRAM GPU.

The software architecture should make that migration require little more than changing the AI server address.

### AI Server Responsibilities

```text
Ollama
│
└── Local abliterated Qwen model

faster-whisper
│
└── Speech-to-text

Eve Agent
│
├── Ollama client
├── MCP client
├── temporary session context
├── tool filtering
├── permissions
└── reasoning-mode control

Kokoro
│
└── Text-to-speech
```

