# Voice Pipeline

The planned voice stack is:

```text
Microphone
    ↓
openWakeWord
    ↓
Silero VAD
    ↓
faster-whisper
    ↓
Eve Agent
    ↓
Qwen
    ↓
MCP / tools
    ↓
Qwen response
    ↓
Kokoro
    ↓
Speakers
```

