# Final Intended Architecture

```text
                         SMART MIRROR
                    ThinkPad T580 Thin Client
                             │
                             │
                ┌────────────┴────────────┐
                │                         │
          openWakeWord                React UI
           "Hey Eve"                  Chromium
                │                         │
              Silero                      │
                │                         │
          audio recording                 │
                │                         │
                └──────────LAN────────────┘
                             │
                             ▼
                     EVE AI SERVER
                             │
                     faster-whisper
                             │
                             ▼
                       Eve Agent
                             │
              ┌──────────────┼──────────────┐
              │              │              │
              ▼              ▼              ▼
           Ollama           MCP          WebSocket
              │              │              │
              ▼              ▼              ▼
        Abliterated Qwen   Services      Dashboard
                             │
                    ┌────────┼────────┐
                    ▼        ▼        ▼
                   Home    Weather  Calendar
                Assistant           Music/Search
                             │
                             ▼
                           Qwen
                             │
                             ▼
                          Kokoro
                             │
                             ▼
                    Mirror speakers
```

## Core Design Principles

1. **Local-first.**
2. **No permanent conversational memory by default.**
3. **Fast/no-think responses for ordinary assistant commands.**
4. **LLM requests actions; deterministic software executes them.**
5. **Credentials remain outside the models.**
6. **Home Assistant remains independent from Eve.**
7. **The mirror remains a lightweight edge client.**
8. **Heavy AI computation runs on a dedicated server.**
9. **MCP is the primary standardized tool interface.**
10. **Each subsystem should be independently testable and replaceable.**
